Package: pve-ui-overlays
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, pve-manager (>= 9)
Description: shared, guarded script injection for the Proxmox VE web UI
 Proxmox VE has no plug-in API for its web UI. This package owns the single
 dpkg diversion of /usr/share/pve-manager/index.html.tpl and renders every
 registered overlay (a JSON descriptor plus a script under
 /usr/share/pve-manager/js/) into the page, so packages that extend the UI
 (qsm-pve-direct, qdev-host-pve, ...) do not depend on their install order.
 The template is patched only for reviewed pve-manager versions; on an
 unknown upgrade the stock page is restored. CLI and Python API:
 register, unregister, enable, disable, reconcile, status, check.
